      "writtenOn": "2025-01-16T21:09:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The comment is about the current pathops impl calling itself. It should call itself directly (when it wants to), and not go through any \"dispatching\" that we may do.\n\nNotice that already, the public differs from what the impl expects, in terms of return style: the (new) public methods return optional\u003c\u003e, while the impl versions return a bool (as they had in the past).",
